Hi=C2=A0B6,

**Organize and manage****your****data****better with Creately =
=F0=9F=92=BB**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Creately combines the ultimate flexibility that a canvas provides with the =
structure and rigidity of a database.=C2=A0

You can bring in data from other apps =C2=A0to visualize them in many =
different views, see the big picture, and generate better insights for =
faster decision-making.=C2=A0

=C2=A0

Whether you need to manage your inventory, create a content calendar, or =
track your employee=E2=80=99s data, let=E2=80=99s see how Creately can help=
 you visualize your data effectively and easily.

**Free your data from tables**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

On Creately, your data exists as =E2=80=98items=E2=80=99 of a visual =
structure as opposed to rows of a sheet.=C2=A0

**Link data and notes to visual items**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Items on a workspace are not just static visuals. They are data-linked and =
context aware.

**View your data in multi-perspectives=C2=A0**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

On Creately, you can show the same item however you want based on the =
context and keep changes you make synced across all the places it=E2=80=99s=
 used in or linked to. =C2=A0

**Augment and extend your work apps**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Bring in items from multiple platforms that are usually not related, =
arrange, group, and move them to create custom workflows. =C2=A0

[Open Creately](https://app.creately.com/)

Learn more neat tips and shortcuts on using Creately [here.=
](https://support.creately.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002882776-Getting-Start=
ed)=C2=A0
=C2=A0

Questions=3F Simply reply to this email and we'll get back to you soon.

